From: mythiccal <cwood2014.cw@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 15:11:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Parallel entity tracker

Derived from Petal's multithreaded tracker; rewritten into a three-phase
scan/apply/send model with join barriers (DivineMC).

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

